            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThis was previously discussed in #431. I still concur the reasoning from that issue and would like this to not be a part of 'mini.files'. With one extra reason: 'mini.nvim' tries to avoid any dependencies when possible and having to rely on three different CLI tools for three platforms does not quite align with this design goal.\r\n\r\nI *really* appreciate the enthusiasm, but this type of PR will not be merged.",
